The marker images in this folder are third-party files, not part of NEWS FLOW:

- marker-icon-2x-*.png: from leaflet-color-markers
  (https://github.com/pointhi/leaflet-color-markers), colour variants of the
  standard Leaflet marker.
- marker-shadow.png: from Leaflet 1.7.1 (https://github.com/Leaflet/Leaflet).

Both are distributed under the BSD 2-Clause License below. The copyright
notice of leaflet-color-markers includes the Leaflet copyright holders.

